// Author: russrimm
// Display name: Cloud Flow Activity - Run Status Summary
// Description: Daily flow run counts by status (Succeeded, Failed, Cancelled, Running)
// Categories: Power Platform
// Resource types: Power Automate
// Topic: Usage Analytics
// Prerequisites: Power Platform admin diagnostic settings connected to Log Analytics workspace

CloudFlowActivity
| where TimeGenerated > ago(30d)
| summarize RunCount=count() by Status=ResultStatus, Day=bin(TimeGenerated, 1d)
| order by Day asc
